# Backspace on the picker's empty filter closes it without typing a slash; Backspace erases filter text first.
file <<END
Work:
	- a
Home:
	- b
END
keys qq
type Fix
keys <Space> /
see Project
type ho
keys <BS> <BS> <BS>
hide Project
see - Fix
hide Fix /
keys / <C-n> <C-n> <C-p> <Enter>
see Quick Add → Work
keys <Enter>
quit
saved <<END
Work:
	- a
	- Fix
Home:
	- b
END
